.vscode/

# Keep the manuscript's portable LaTeX Workshop recipe under version control.
!BioMedSem_2026/paper/.vscode/
!BioMedSem_2026/paper/.vscode/settings.json

# Benchmark suite: keep the analysis outputs and the run records (small, and
# the reason a number is interpretable later); drop the bulk. Note the
# negation for derived-input provenance — vcf_data/ is ignored wholesale, but
# those JSONs are what makes a derived ladder reproducible.
benchmarks/results/**/out/
benchmarks/results/**/*.log
benchmarks/results/**/workspace_bytes.tsv
!vcf_data/derived/*.provenance.json

# The benchmark VM points the suite at benchmarks_outputs/ via BM_RESULTS.
# Mirror the benchmarks/results/ policy for that path: keep the analysis
# outputs and run records, drop the bulk.
benchmarks_outputs/**/out/
benchmarks_outputs/**/*.log
benchmarks_outputs/**/workspace_bytes.tsv
